# Response headers. Cloudflare Pages reads this file verbatim; scripts/serve.py
# parses it so the SAME policy is enforced during local development.
#
# Why this file exists rather than <meta> tags: CSP frame-ancestors,
# X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy and HSTS are only honoured as response
# headers. A CSP that is not served is not a CSP, and one first discovered at
# deploy time is one that gets waived under pressure.
#
# default-src 'none' means every resource class must be named explicitly below.
# Adding a directive here is a security decision — see docs/phase-1-scope.md §4.2.
#
# connect-src needs 'self' for /data/lookup.json, /data/districts.geo.json and
# /manifest.json. Omitting it broke local address resolution and the staleness notice
# (docs/OBSERVATIONS.md, 2026-09-23). tests/unit/test_csp.py now checks this list
# against every URL the frontend fetches.
#
# server.arcgisonline.com serves the basemap: Esri's Light Gray Canvas, chosen 2026-10-26
# over OpenFreeMap's positron for its park colours and its labelling at lower zoom. Raster
# tiles, and MapLibre fetches those, so connect-src is the only directive needed — img-src,
# worker-src and blob: were each measured unnecessary on 2026-10-22 and the same holds here.
# Esri sends `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`.
#
# Two things this line carries. It withdrew the "no third party sees a reader's request"
# promise, recorded as an owner decision in product-brief.md §5. And it is a *commercial*
# Esri service whose keyless endpoints nobody here has confirmed are licensed for this use;
# the owner chose them knowing that. Attribution is set on the source in map.mjs.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://geosearch.planninglabs.nyc https://server.arcgisonline.com; form-action 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
